(Bug #27 regression: a period must close a Repeat body. Before the fix
 the period did not close it, so "after" was silently absorbed as a second
 per-iteration action and printed `r after r after`. The fix makes a
 period end the body unconditionally, the same as While, so "after" runs
 once, after the loop. Expected: r, r, after.)

Repeat 2 times, Print "r".
Print "after".